 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nZürichsee Handels AG                                      MASTER SERVICES\nBahnhofstrasse 12, 1201 Genève, Switzerland               AGREEMENT\nMWST-Nr: CHE-217.615.301 MWST\nReg No: CH-684141\n\nFROM                                                     RECHNUNGSADRESSE\nZürichsee Handels AG                                     Zürichsee Handels AG\nBahnhofstrasse 12                                        Industriestrasse 55\n1201 Genève                                              8001 Zürich\nSwitzerland                                              Switzerland\nVAT: CHE-217.615.301 MWST\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 19.03.2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Zürichsee\nHandels AG, with its registered office at Bahnhofstrasse 12, Genève (\"Party A\"), and Zürichsee Handels AG, with its registered office at\nIndustriestrasse 55, Zürich (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Zürichsee Handels AG / Beat Steiner\nParty B      Zürichsee Handels AG / Claudia Frei\nDate         19.03.2026",
